OL,3,GNEWSAGlobe opens Shakespeare library
OL,4,Aand archive
OL,5,
OL,6,FShakespeare's Globe has opened a new
OL,7,Fresearch centre on its Bankside site,
OL,8,Fwhich it says is London's only
OL,9,Fdedicated Shakespeare library and
OL,10,Farchive open to the public.
OL,12,FThe Research and Collections Centre
OL,13,Fholds more than 6,000 books on
OL,14,FShakespeare as well as early modern
OL,15,Fliterature and drama, alongside the
OL,16,Ftheatre's own archive of past
OL,17,Fproductions.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
