OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGlobe opens Shakespeare library
OL,4,Aand archive
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rare book collection includes
OL,7,Fnearly 500 plays, poems and other works
OL,8,Ffrom the 16th and 17th centuries, among
OL,9,Fthem a second folio edition of
OL,10,FShakespeare's complete works, published
OL,11,Fin 1632.
OL,13,FEntry is free, but anyone wanting to
OL,14,Fconsult the collections has to register
OL,15,Fand book an appointment in advance
OL,16,Fbecause of the nature of the material.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
